        addToNavbar(title);

        SideNav nav = new SideNav();
        addToDrawer(nav);
    }
}
```

---

## 2. H1 and H2 Components

**Java Class Names:** `H1`, `H2`

**Package:** `com.vaadin.flow.component.html`

**Module:** `flow-html-components`

**Usage Example:**
```java
H1 mainTitle = new H1("Page Title");
H2 sectionTitle = new H2("Section Title");
add(mainTitle, sectionTitle);
```

---

## 3. TextField Component

**Java Class Name:** `TextField`

**Package:** `com.vaadin.flow.component.textfield`

**Maven Artifact:** `com.vaadin:vaadin-text-field-flow`

**Usage Example:**
```java
TextField textField = new TextField();
textField.setLabel("Street Address");
textField.setValue("Ruukinkatu 2");
textField.setClearButtonVisible(true);
add(textField);
```

---

## 4. Button Component

**Java Class Name:** `Button`

**Package:** `com.vaadin.flow.component.button`

**Maven Artifact:** `com.vaadin:vaadin-button-flow`

**Usage Example:**
```java
Button button = new Button("Click Me");
button.addClickListener(event -> {
    // Handle click
});
add(button);
```

---

## 5. ListItem and UnorderedList Components

**Status:** YES, both components exist in Vaadin 25.2

**Java Class Names:** `ListItem`, `UnorderedList`

**Package:** `com.vaadin.flow.component.html`

**Module:** `flow-html-components`

**Usage Example:**
```java
UnorderedList list = new UnorderedList(
    new ListItem("First item"),
    new ListItem("Second item"),
    new ListItem("Third item")
);
add(list);

// ListItems can also contain components
ListItem item = new ListItem();
item.add(new Span("Visit "));
item.add(new Anchor("https://vaadin.com", "vaadin.com"));
```

---

## 6. Span Component

**Java Class Name:** `Span`

**Package:** `com.vaadin.flow.component.html`

**Module:** `flow-html-components`

**Usage Example:**
```java
Span span = new Span("Inline text content");
span.getStyle().set("color", "blue");
add(span);

// Span with suffix component
TextField field = new TextField();
field.setSuffixComponent(new Span(":)"));
```

